OL,3,GNEWSAAsylum centre on military base
OL,4,Anear Piddington approved
OL,5,
OL,6,FPiddington symbolically voted to leave
OL,7,Fthe UK over the planned use for the
OL,8,Fsite, which has also been legally
OL,9,Fchallenged by campaigners. Opponents
OL,10,Fnow have six weeks to challenge the
OL,11,Fapproval.
